# Template for secrets. It contains NO real keys and is safe to publish.
#
# How to use:
#   1. Make a copy of this file named .env (ask Claude: "create .env from the example").
#   2. Open .env yourself and paste the real keys. Do not paste keys into the chat.
#
# .env is ignored by git and blocked for Claude; scripts read it themselves.
# The example MCP server (sviy-laws) needs no key: sign in with Google via /mcp.

# EXAMPLE_API_KEY=paste-your-key-here
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=paste-your-token-here
